Package: uke-image-tools
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Native Uke image format and payload inspection tools
 Builds the shared boot-image, sparse-image, EXT4-label, payload, language and
 root-metadata tools. Does not run the Fedora image composer or include its
 guest operating-system archive. No system image is built during packaging.
